# Chat pembeli <-> toko dan tiket WebSocket. Akun: Budi (pembeli), pemilik Warung Bu Sari (mitra). Password123!
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3030/api/v1
@sariMerchant = 7b9a2c9e-0000-0000-0000-000000000000 # ganti: GET /me/merchant sebagai owner-m1

### Login pembeli
# @name buyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi.santoso@gmail.com", "password": "Password123!" }

### Login mitra
# @name seller
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner-m1@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

### Id toko Rina
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/merchant
Authorization: Bearer {{seller.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Mulai percakapan
# @name conv
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchant_id": "{{sariMerchant}}" }

### Kirim pesan (client_id sama = idempoten)
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conv.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "client_id": "7b1f5d1e-5c0e-4f57-9a35-2b9f2b9a0001", "body": "Masih ada?" }

### Kotak masuk mitra
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations?as=merchant
Authorization: Bearer {{seller.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Pesan
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conv.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{seller.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Tandai dibaca
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conv.response.body.$.data.id}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{seller.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "last_read_id": 1 }

### Tiket WebSocket (30 detik, sekali pakai) -> ws://localhost:3030/ws?ticket=<ticket>
POST {{baseUrl}}/ws/ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
